Files vendored here, unchanged:

- elk-0.9.3.bundled.js, elk-LICENSE.md: elkjs 0.9.3, the Eclipse Layout Kernel (EPL-2.0), as
  LeanTrustBuilders/referee-site vendors it (v0.12.0, referee_site/static/vendor/).
- katex.v0.16.28.min.js, KaTeX-LICENSE.txt: KaTeX 0.16.28 (MIT), as the Tau Ceti Atlas vendors it
  (CBirkbeck/tauceti-explorer at 701724066b7e, vendor/).
- markdown.js: the Tau Ceti Atlas's Markdown renderer (CBirkbeck/tauceti-explorer at 701724066b7e,
  src/markdown.js, Apache-2.0): source HTML stays text, links are filtered, and mathematics becomes
  vetted MathML through KaTeX.
- fonts/: Source Serif 4, Inter and JetBrains Mono (each under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, its
  licence beside it), the latin, latin-ext and greek subsets Google Fonts serves (fonts.gstatic.com,
  October 2026: Source Serif 4 v15, Inter v20, JetBrains Mono v24), the faces Mathlib Explorer uses;
  fonts.css is Google's stylesheet for them, pointed at these files.

web/style.css and web/app.js follow Mathlib Explorer's page (LeanTrustBuilders/mathlib-explorer at
46e838a, mathlib_explorer/static/style.css and app.js; Apache-2.0): its layout and type, its lists, and
its words for Lean's basic notions (BASIC_WORDS). web/map.js adapts referee-site's layered graphs
(referee_site/static/core.js: layout, transitiveReduction, placeWithElk, placeInRows, pan and zoom;
Apache-2.0).
